{
  "lessonId": "L3M2L1",
  "title": "MGA 與 Cru 系統詳解",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1976d2 0%,#1565c0 100%)'><h1>🗺️ MGA 與 Cru 系統詳解</h1><p class='subtitle'>Barolo & Barbaresco 的精準風土密碼</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>📍 什麼是 MGA？</h2><div class='mga-introduction'><div class='definition-panel'><h3>MGA = Menzioni Geografiche Aggiuntive</h3><h4>（附加地理標示）</h4><div class='definition-box'><p>MGA 是義大利葡萄酒法規中的官方術語，允許生產者在酒標上標示<strong>更小的地理單位</strong>，標明葡萄的確切來源地。</p></div></div><div class='timeline-evolution'><h4>⏰ Barolo MGA 發展史</h4><div class='timeline-container'><div class='timeline-item milestone-2010'><div class='year'>2010</div><div class='event-title'>MGA 制度正式實施</div><div class='event-detail'><ul><li>170 個葡萄園獲得 MGA 認證</li><li>涵蓋 Barolo 11 個村莊</li><li>每個 MGA 有精確的邊界和面積</li></ul></div></div><div class='timeline-item milestone-debate'><div class='year'>2010-2020</div><div class='event-title'>產業爭議期</div><div class='event-detail'><ul><li>傳統派：應回歸村莊名稱</li><li>現代派：MGA 是精準風土的必要工具</li><li>消費者：170 個名字太多太混亂</li></ul></div></div><div class='timeline-item milestone-now'><div class='year'>2020-現在</div><div class='event-title'>普及與國際認可</div><div class='event-detail'><ul><li>頂級生產者廣泛使用 MGA</li><li>國際市場接受度增加</li><li>價格與 MGA 聲譽高度相關</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class='comparison-box'><h4>🆚 MGA vs 法國 Cru 系統</h4><table class='comparison-table'><thead><tr><th>特性</th><th>Burgundy Cru 系統</th><th>Barolo MGA 系統</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>歷史</strong></td><td>13 世紀開始，數百年演變</td><td>2010 年正式實施（非常新）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>分級</strong></td><td>Grand Cru / Premier Cru / Village</td><td>無官方分級（僅地理標示）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>數量</strong></td><td>Burgundy 有 33 個 Grand Cru</td><td>Barolo 有 170 個 MGA</td></tr><tr><td><strong>法規地位</strong></td><td>AOC 法規明確分級</td><td>僅標示地理來源，無品質分級</td></tr><tr><td><strong>市場認知</strong></td><td>全球公認的品質保證</td><td>專業圈認可，普通消費者陌生</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Barolo 11 大村莊與 MGA 分佈</h2><div class='villages-overview'><div class='villages-grid'><div class='village-card serralunga'><div class='village-header'><h4>Serralunga d'Alba</h4><div class='terroir-badge'>結構派 💪</div></div><div class='soil-type'>土壤：Helvetian 砂岩（藍色泥灰岩）</div><div class='style-note'>風格：單寧強勁、需長時間陳年</div><div class='top-mgas'><h5>🏆 頂級 MGA</h5><ul><li><strong>Vigna Rionda</strong> - \"Barolo 之王\"</li><li><strong>Francia</strong> - Giacomo Conterno 傳奇</li><li><strong>Lazzarito</strong> - 力量與優雅的平衡</li><li><strong>Ornato</strong> - Pio Cesare 代表作</li></ul></div><div class='mgas-count'>MGA 總數：<strong>24 個</strong></div></div><div class='village-card barolo'><div class='village-header'><h4>Barolo 村</h4><div class='terroir-badge'>平衡派 ⚖️</div></div><div class='soil-type'>土壤：混合土質（砂岩+泥灰岩）</div><div class='style-note'>風格：優雅與力量兼備</div><div class='top-mgas'><h5>🏆 頂級 MGA</h5><ul><li><strong>Cannubi</strong> - Barolo 歷史心臟</li><li><strong>Brunate</strong> - 細膩芳香</li><li><strong>Cerequio</strong> - 優雅派代表</li><li><strong>Sarmassa</strong> - 長壽型</li></ul></div><div class='mgas-count'>MGA 總數：<strong>31 個</strong></div></div><div class='village-card lamorra'><div class='village-header'><h4>La Morra</h4><div class='terroir-badge'>優雅派 🌹</div></div><div class='soil-type'>土壤：Tortonian 泥灰岩（白色）</div><div class='style-note'>風格：芳香、細膩、較早適飲</div><div class='top-mgas'><h5>🏆 頂級 MGA</h5><ul><li><strong>Brunate</strong> - 與 Barolo 村共享</li><li><strong>Cerequio</strong> - 部分與 Barolo 村共享</li><li><strong>Rocche dell'Annunziata</strong> - 優雅標竿</li><li><strong>La Serra</strong> - 高海拔風土</li></ul></div><div class='mgas-count'>MGA 總數：<strong>35 個</strong></div></div><div class='village-card monforte'><div class='village-header'><h4>Monforte d'Alba</h4><div class='terroir-badge'>現代派先鋒 🚀</div></div><div class='soil-type'>土壤：Helvetian 砂岩+石灰岩</div><div class='style-note'>風格：飽滿、現代、單寧成熟</div><div class='top-mgas'><h5>🏆 頂級 MGA</h5><ul><li><strong>Bussia</strong> - Barolo 最大的單一 MGA</li><li><strong>Ginestra</strong> - Elio Grasso 名園</li><li><strong>Mosconi</strong> - 高海拔傑作</li><li><strong>Gramolere</strong> - Vajra 代表作</li></ul></div><div class='mgas-count'>MGA 總數：<strong>27 個</strong></div></div><div class='village-card castiglione'><div class='village-header'><h4>Castiglione Falletto</h4><div class='terroir-badge'>經典派 👑</div></div><div class='soil-type'>土壤：混合土質（複雜）</div><div class='style-note'>風格：強勁、複雜、長壽</div><div class='top-mgas'><h5>🏆 頂級 MGA</h5><ul><li><strong>Monprivato</strong> - Giuseppe Mascarello 獨佔園</li><li><strong>Villero</strong> - Vietti、Brovia 傑作</li><li><strong>Bricco Boschis</strong> - Cavallotto 獨佔園</li><li><strong>Rocche di Castiglione</strong> - Brovia 傳奇</li></ul></div><div class='mgas-count'>MGA 總數：<strong>22 個</strong></div></div><div class='village-card others'><div class='village-header'><h4>其他 6 個村莊</h4><div class='terroir-badge'>小而美 ⭐</div></div><div class='villages-list'><div class='minor-village'><h6>Verduno</h6><p>MGA：8 個｜風格：細膩、芳香</p></div><div class='minor-village'><h6>Grinzane Cavour</h6><p>MGA：6 個｜風格：平衡</p></div><div class='minor-village'><h6>Diano d'Alba</h6><p>MGA：5 個｜風格：優雅</p></div><div class='minor-village'><h6>Cherasco</h6><p>MGA：5 個｜風格：新興</p></div><div class='minor-village'><h6>Novello</h6><p>MGA：4 個｜風格：年輕</p></div><div class='minor-village'><h6>Roddi</h6><p>MGA：3 個｜風格：輕盈</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>👑 Barolo 傳奇 MGA 深度解析</h2><div class='legendary-mgas'><div class='mga-profile cannubi'><div class='mga-header'><h3>Cannubi - Barolo 的心臟</h3><div class='location-info'>村莊：Barolo ｜ 海拔：250-300m ｜ 朝向：南/西南</div></div><div class='historical-significance'><h5>📜 歷史地位</h5><ul><li>Barolo 產區<strong>最古老</strong>且最有名的葡萄園</li><li>1752 年就有文獻記載</li><li>19 世紀被認為是整個 Barolo 最佳風土</li><li>名字來源：<em>Canova</em>（地窖），暗示其古老地位</li></ul></div><div class='terroir-details'><h5>🪨 風土特性</h5><div class='terroir-grid'><div class='detail-item'><strong>土壤結構：</strong>Tortonian 泥灰岩（富含貝殼化石）</div><div class='detail-item'><strong>質地：</strong>鬆軟、排水良好</div><div class='detail-item'><strong>特點：</strong>賦予酒款<strong>細膩香氣和優雅結構</strong></div><div class='detail-item'><strong>葡萄成熟：</strong>較早（溫暖微氣候）</div></div></div><div class='wine-characteristics'><h5>🍷 酒款風格</h5><div class='characteristics-list'><div class='char-item'>🌹 <strong>香氣：</strong>玫瑰花瓣、紅櫻桃、甘草、香料</div><div class='char-item'>⚖️ <strong>結構：</strong>優雅而非強勁、單寧細緻</div><div class='char-item'>💎 <strong>複雜度：</strong>極高、層次豐富</div><div class='char-item'>⏰ <strong>陳年潛力：</strong>20-40 年（頂級年份）</div></div></div><div class='producers-section'><h5>🏅 頂級生產者</h5><div class='producers-grid'><div class='producer-item'><h6>Luciano Sandrone</h6><p class='style'>現代派大師｜濃郁而平衡</p><p class='price'>€200-350</p></div><div class='producer-item'><h6>Marchesi di Barolo</h6><p class='style'>傳統派｜歷史最悠久擁有者</p><p class='price'>€80-150</p></div><div class='producer-item'><h6>E. Pira & Figli - Chiara Boschis</h6><p class='style'>優雅現代派｜細膩女性風格</p><p class='price'>€150-280</p></div><div class='producer-item'><h6>Paolo Scavino</h6><p class='style'>現代經典｜力量與優雅</p><p class='price'>€120-220</p></div></div></div><div class='controversy-box'><h5>⚠️ Cannubi 爭議</h5><p>「Cannubi」名稱被多個生產者使用，導致市場混淆：</p><ul><li><strong>Cannubi</strong>（核心園）- 真正的經典</li><li><strong>Cannubi Boschis</strong> - 鄰近園，風格不同</li><li><strong>Cannubi San Lorenzo</strong> - 另一鄰近園</li><li><strong>Cannubi Muscatel</strong> - 歷史園塊</li></ul><p class='warning-note'>💡 選購時務必確認是「Cannubi」核心園，避免混淆。</p></div></div><div class='mga-profile vigna-rionda'><div class='mga-header'><h3>Vigna Rionda - Barolo 之王</h3><div class='location-info'>村莊：Serralunga d'Alba ｜ 海拔：300-360m ｜ 朝向：南</div></div><div class='legendary-status'><h5>👑 傳奇地位</h5><blockquote class='legendary-quote'><p>「Vigna Rionda 是 Barolo 的 Romanée-Conti。」</p><cite>- 義大利葡萄酒評論家</cite></blockquote><ul><li>被公認為<strong>Serralunga 最佳風土</strong></li><li>僅 4 家生產者擁有葡萄園（極少）</li><li>Giacomo Conterno 旗艦園（但稱為 \"Francia\"）</li><li>價格與世界頂級葡萄酒並列</li></ul></div><div class='terroir-details'><h5>🪨 風土特性</h5><div class='terroir-grid'><div class='detail-item'><strong>土壤：</strong>Helvetian 砂岩（藍色泥灰岩）- 富含礦物質</div><div class='detail-item'><strong>海拔：</strong>Serralunga 最高位置之一</div><div class='detail-item'><strong>朝向：</strong>正南（日照極佳）</div><div class='detail-item'><strong>排水：</strong>完美（斜坡陡峭）</div></div></div><div class='wine-characteristics'><h5>🍷 酒款風格</h5><div class='characteristics-list'><div class='char-item'>💪 <strong>結構：</strong>Barolo 最強勁、需 15-20 年陳年</div><div class='char-item'>⚫ <strong>顏色：</strong>深邃石榴紅、幾乎不透光</div><div class='char-item'>🔥 <strong>單寧：</strong>極高但細緻、如絲絨</div><div class='char-item'>🍊 <strong>香氣：</strong>黑色漿果、焦油、玫瑰、甘草、菸草</div><div class='char-item'>⏰ <strong>陳年潛力：</strong>30-50 年（世界級長壽）</div></div></div><div class='producers-section'><h5>🏅 頂級生產者（僅 4 家擁有）</h5><div class='producers-grid exclusive'><div class='producer-item exclusive-1'><h6>Giacomo Conterno - \"Francia\"</h6><p class='style'><strong>獨佔園｜傳奇中的傳奇</strong></p><p class='flagship'>Barolo Riserva Monfortino Francia</p><p class='price'>€800-2000+（年份酒更高）</p><p class='note'>⚠️ Conterno 家族自己的稱呼，但實際就是 Vigna Rionda</p></div><div class='producer-item exclusive-2'><h6>Massolino</h6><p class='style'>傳統派｜純粹風土表達</p><p class='flagship'>Barolo Vigna Rionda Riserva</p><p class='price'>€150-300</p></div><div class='producer-item exclusive-3'><h6>Oddero</h6><p class='style'>家族老莊｜經典風格</p><p class='flagship'>Barolo Vigna Rionda</p><p class='price'>€120-250</p></div><div class='producer-item exclusive-4'><h6>Bruno Giacosa（已退休）</h6><p class='style'>傳奇釀酒師｜紅標是聖杯</p><p class='flagship'>Barolo Vigna Rionda DOCG 紅標</p><p class='price'>€500-1500（拍賣行情）</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Barbaresco 的 Cru 系統</h2><div class='barbaresco-system'><div class='intro-panel'><h4>📍 Barbaresco 與 Barolo 的差異</h4><div class='difference-grid'><div class='diff-item'><h6>規模</h6><p><strong>Barbaresco：</strong>約 700 公頃</p><p><strong>Barolo：</strong>約 2,000 公頃（3倍大）</p></div><div class='diff-item'><h6>MGA 數量</h6><p><strong>Barbaresco：</strong>66 個 MGA</p><p><strong>Barolo：</strong>170 個 MGA</p></div><div class='diff-item'><h6>陳年要求</h6><p><strong>Barbaresco：</strong>26 個月（其中 9 個月橡木桶）</p><p><strong>Barolo：</strong>38 個月（其中 18 個月橡木桶）</p></div><div class='diff-item'><h6>風格特點</h6><p><strong>Barbaresco：</strong>較優雅、細緻、早適飲</p><p><strong>Barolo：</strong>較強勁、結構、需長陳年</p></div></div></div><div class='three-villages'><h4>🏘️ Barbaresco 三大村莊</h4><div class='villages-comparison'><div class='barbaresco-village neive'><h5>Neive</h5><div class='village-stats'><div class='stat'>MGA 數量：<strong>17 個</strong></div><div class='stat'>海拔：<strong>200-420m</strong></div><div class='stat'>土壤：<strong>砂岩為主</strong></div></div><div class='top-crus'><h6>🏆 頂級 Cru</h6><ul><li><strong>Santo Stefano</strong> - Castello di Neive 獨佔園</li><li><strong>Gallina</strong> - La Spinetta 傑作</li><li><strong>Albesani</strong> - Bruno Giacosa 傳奇</li><li><strong>Cottà</strong> - Moccagatta 代表作</li></ul></div><div class='style-note'>風格：<strong>結構強勁、單寧明顯、需陳年</strong></div></div><div class='barbaresco-village barbaresco'><h5>Barbaresco 村</h5><div class='village-stats'><div class='stat'>MGA 數量：<strong>23 個</strong></div><div class='stat'>海拔：<strong>150-350m</strong></div><div class='stat'>土壤：<strong>泥灰岩+砂岩</strong></div></div><div class='top-crus'><h6>🏆 頂級 Cru</h6><ul><li><strong>Asili</strong> - Produttori 精華、優雅派</li><li><strong>Rabajà</strong> - Bruno Rocca 名園、力量派</li><li><strong>Montefico</strong> - Produttori 獨佔園</li><li><strong>Martinenga</strong> - Marchesi di Grésy 獨佔園</li></ul></div><div class='style-note'>風格：<strong>優雅與力量平衡、經典 Barbaresco</strong></div></div><div class='barbaresco-village treiso'><h5>Treiso</h5><div class='village-stats'><div class='stat'>MGA 數量：<strong>16 個</strong></div><div class='stat'>海拔：<strong>250-450m</strong></div><div class='stat'>土壤：<strong>泥灰岩為主</strong></div></div><div class='top-crus'><h6>🏆 頂級 Cru</h6><ul><li><strong>Pajé</strong> - Barbaresco 之王（與 Asili 齊名）</li><li><strong>Nervo</strong> - Albino Rocca 代表作</li><li><strong>Bernardot</strong> - Ceretto 經典</li></ul></div><div class='style-note'>風格：<strong>細膩、芳香、早適飲（較高海拔）</strong></div></div><div class='barbaresco-village sanrocco'><h5>San Rocco Seno d'Elvio</h5><div class='village-stats'><div class='stat'>MGA 數量：<strong>10 個</strong></div><div class='stat'>海拔：<strong>220-320m</strong></div><div class='stat'>土壤：<strong>混合</strong></div></div><div class='note-panel'>第四個小村莊，產量極少，以小生產者酒莊為主。</div></div></div></div><div class='legendary-crus'><h4>👑 Barbaresco 三大傳奇 Cru</h4><div class='cru-profiles'><div class='cru-card asili'><h5>Asili - 優雅女王</h5><div class='cru-details'><div class='detail'>村莊：Barbaresco｜海拔：280-320m｜朝向：西南</div><div class='detail'>土壤：泥灰岩（白色）｜風格：極致優雅、細膩</div><div class='detail'>香氣：玫瑰花瓣、紅色漿果、香料、礦物感</div><div class='detail'>陳年：15-30 年</div></div><div class='top-producer'><strong>頂級生產者：</strong>Produttori del Barbaresco（合作社）- Asili Riserva 紅標（€120-250）</div></div><div class='cru-card rabaja'><h5>Rabajà - 力量之王</h5><div class='cru-details'><div class='detail'>村莊：Barbaresco｜海拔：250-300m｜朝向：南</div><div class='detail'>土壤：砂岩（黃色）｜風格：強勁、結構、單寧高</div><div class='detail'>香氣：黑色漿果、焦油、菸草、皮革</div><div class='detail'>陳年：20-35 年</div></div><div class='top-producer'><strong>頂級生產者：</strong>Bruno Rocca, Giuseppe Cortese, Paitin（€80-180）</div></div><div class='cru-card paje'><h5>Pajé - 複雜度之冠</h5><div class='cru-details'><div class='detail'>村莊：Treiso｜海拔：280-380m｜朝向：南/西南</div><div class='detail'>土壤：泥灰岩主導｜風格：複雜、層次、平衡</div><div class='detail'>香氣：紅色漿果、花香、香料、礦物、松露</div><div class='detail'>陳年：15-30 年</div></div><div class='top-producer'><strong>頂級生產者：</strong>Roagna（傳奇）, Secondine（€100-220）</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📋 如何解讀 MGA 酒標</h2><div class='label-reading-guide'><div class='label-example'><h4>🏷️ 酒標範例解析</h4><div class='mock-label'><div class='producer-name'>Paolo Scavino</div><div class='wine-name'>Barolo</div><div class='mga-name'>CANNUBI</div><div class='vintage'>2016</div><div class='designation'>DOCG</div></div><div class='label-breakdown'><div class='breakdown-item producer'><span class='icon'>🏛️</span><div class='content'><h6>生產者</h6><p><strong>Paolo Scavino</strong> - 現代派名莊</p></div></div><div class='breakdown-item appellation'><span class='icon'>📍</span><div class='content'><h6>法定產區</h6><p><strong>Barolo DOCG</strong> - 義大利最高等級</p></div></div><div class='breakdown-item mga'><span class='icon'>🗺️</span><div class='content'><h6>MGA 標示</h6><p><strong>Cannubi</strong> - 附加地理標示（單一葡萄園）</p></div></div><div class='breakdown-item vintage'><span class='icon'>📅</span><div class='content'><h6>年份</h6><p><strong>2016</strong> - 頂級年份（五星）</p></div></div></div></div><div class='mandatory-requirements'><h4>⚖️ MGA 標示法規要求</h4><div class='requirements-panel'><div class='requirement-item'><div class='icon'>🍇</div><h6>100% 來自該 MGA</h6><p>葡萄必須<strong>100% 種植在標示的 MGA 範圍內</strong>，不可混其他葡萄園。</p></div><div class='requirement-item'><div class='icon'>📏</div><h6>產量限制</h6><p>每公頃最多 <strong>8,000 公斤</strong>葡萄（比基本 Barolo 更嚴格）。</p></div><div class='requirement-item'><div class='icon'>⏳</div><h6>陳年時間</h6><p>與基本 Barolo 相同（38 個月），但頂級生產者通常陳年更久。</p></div><div class='requirement-item'><div class='icon'>🏷️</div><h6>酒標字體大小</h6><p>MGA 名稱<strong>不可大於產區名稱</strong>（防止誤導消費者）。</p></div></div></div><div class='reading-tips'><h4>💡 選購技巧</h4><div class='tips-grid'><div class='tip-card'><h6>🎯 認識頂級 MGA</h6><ul><li>熟記 10-15 個最知名 MGA</li><li>如：Cannubi, Brunate, Vigna Rionda, Bussia, Asili, Pajé</li><li>這些 MGA 通常價格較高但品質有保證</li></ul></div><div class='tip-card'><h6>👨‍🌾 生產者比 MGA 更重要</h6><ul><li>同一 MGA 由不同生產者釀造，風格差異極大</li><li>頂級生產者的「普通」MGA 常勝過二流生產者的頂級 MGA</li><li>優先選擇知名生產者</li></ul></div><div class='tip-card'><h6>📅 年份影響巨大</h6><ul><li>Nebbiolo 極度依賴年份</li><li>頂級年份：2016, 2013, 2010, 2006, 2004</li><li>普通年份的頂級 MGA 可能不如好年份的基本款</li></ul></div><div class='tip-card'><h6>💰 性價比策略</h6><ul><li>避開最熱門 MGA（如 Cannubi），選擇同村其他園</li><li>關注新興生產者的知名 MGA</li><li>Barbaresco 的頂級 Cru 通常比 Barolo 便宜 30-40%</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 專家重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ MGA（Menzioni Geografiche Aggiuntive）是 2010 年正式實施的地理標示系統</div><div class='point'>✓ Barolo 有 170 個 MGA 分佈在 11 個村莊，Barbaresco 有 66 個 MGA 分佈在 3-4 個村莊</div><div class='point'>✓ Cannubi 是 Barolo 最古老且最有名的葡萄園，但存在名稱混淆問題</div><div class='point'>✓ Vigna Rionda（又稱 Francia）被公認為 Serralunga 最佳風土，僅 4 家生產者擁有</div><div class='point'>✓ Giacomo Conterno Monfortino Francia 是 Barolo 的最高峰之一（€800-2000+）</div><div class='point'>✓ Barbaresco 三大傳奇 Cru：Asili（優雅）、Rabajà（力量）、Pajé（複雜）</div><div class='point'>✓ MGA 標示要求葡萄 100% 來自該園，且字體不可大於產區名稱</div><div class='point'>✓ 選酒時，生產者比 MGA 更重要，年份影響也極大</div></div></section></div><style>.mga-introduction{padding:40px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.definition-panel{text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e3f2fd,#bbdefb);padding:35px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:35px;border:4px solid #1976d2}.definition-panel h3{margin:0;font-size:2.2rem;color:#1565c0;font-weight:800}.definition-panel h4{margin:10px 0 20px;font-size:1.4rem;color:#0d47a1;font-style:italic}.definition-box{background:#fff;padding:25px 30px;border-radius:15px;margin-top:20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.definition-box p{margin:0;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.9;color:#2c3e50}.definition-box strong{color:#1976d2}.timeline-evolution h4{color:#1976d2;font-size:1.6rem;margin:35px 0 25px;text-align:center}.timeline-container{display:grid;gap:25px}.timeline-item{padding:30px;border-radius:15px;border-left:6px solid #1976d2;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f5f5f5);box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.timeline-item .year{display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1976d2,#1565c0);color:#fff;border-radius:25px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px}.timeline-item .event-title{font-size:1.3rem;color:#1976d2;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0}.timeline-item ul{margin:12px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:2}.timeline-item li{color:#2c3e